SUMMARY:Special Event: Erin Cholakian
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 1510 SE 9th Ave\, Portland
DESCRIPTION:Erin Cholakian is a comedian\, improviser\, and actress based i
 n Los Angeles. Just like her name\, she’s half Irish and half Armenian—
 so she’s got the gift of gab and she’s not afraid to use it. Her comedy
  is best described as chaotic good\, she’s the girl at the party who alwa
 ys has the most insane stories and a hilarious way of recounting them.\n\nS
 he’s best known for her viral clips on socials\, growing a devoted audien
 ce who’s always waiting for the next thing Erin has gotten herself into. 
 From giving her number to Jason Segel\, coaching Michael B Jordan on how to
  throw an axe\, and crowd work that turns ex-husbands gay\, she’s a jar f
 ull of mayhem.\n\nErin most recently has been touring the country with the 
 Heated Rivalry Comedy Show\, a show she created in January of 2026 based on
  the hit Crave TV show. Her and her co-producer Madi Walser have delighted 
 audiences in more than 12 cities with powerpoint presentations\, give-aways
 \, and goody bags creating a safe space for fans of the show to connect wit
 h each other and the local comedians they find in each city.\n\nErin is als
 o 1/3 of the comedy trio The Brunettes who have toured the US in their shar
 ed headlining show. Erin along with her fellow brunettes Anastasia Jacques 
 and Grace Bahler will be dropping a podcast by the end of the year to conti
 nue growing their shared audience.\n\nCouple's Package includes:\n\n- 2 pre
 mium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ti
 cket Protection\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent customers from 
 entering the facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patron
 s.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/special-event-eri
